  - name: "Imperial Dragon Body (AT-C10000)"
    description: "A full conversion heavy assault cyborg built as a four-legged, serpentine dragon rather than a humanoid. Main body 350 M.D.C. (stored); it cannot wear additional body armor, which is built in. M.D.C. by location: hands/feet (2) 20 each*, forelegs/arms (2) 50 each, hind legs (2) 60 each, prehensile tail 50 per 6 ft (1.8 m) of length*, double laser turrets (2, rear sides) 80 each*, mini-missile launchers (2, sides) 100 each*, triple-barrelled particle beam gun 100, smoke dispenser 20, head 100 (reinforced)*. Locations marked * need a called shot at -3 to strike; destroying the head kills the character. Depleting the main body destroys the body, but emergency systems keep the brain alive for 36 hours; 125 or more points below zero destroys the ''borg beyond recovery. Bionic P.S. 30, P.P. 22 and Spd 176 (stored). Runs at 120 mph (192 km) on four legs, only 20 mph (32 kph) on two. The snake body springs 30 ft (9 m) high or lengthwise; a running leap adds 1D4x10 yards/meters. Cannot fly. 5 ft (1.5 m) tall on all fours, 9 ft (2.7 m) rearing up, 24 ft (7.2 m) long, 1500 lbs (675 kg). Nuclear power, 20-year life. Market cost ten million credits; built by ArmaTech exclusively for the Republic''s military and police, and outside the Republic only Ichto makes them, at 10% more."
  - name: "Standard Bionic Features"
